---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Download" description="NovelTea development download information.">
  <section class="nt-page-heading">
    <p class="nt-status">Pre-release</p>
    <h1>Downloads will follow the first public builds.</h1>
    <p>
      NovelTea is still under active development. The desktop editor will be the primary download, with the standalone
      CLI available for automation and headless workflows once public build publishing is enabled.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="nt-grid" aria-label="Planned NovelTea downloads">
    <article class="nt-card">
      <h2>Desktop editor</h2>
      <p>The main authoring experience for creating, previewing, and exporting NovelTea projects.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="nt-card">
      <h2>Standalone CLI</h2>
      <p>Headless validation, export, and automation tooling for advanced workflows and continuous integration.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
